  "body": "The moment you arrive, you can picture your morning coffee, relaxing weekends, and the simple pleasure of coming home. Welcome to 155D Bonair, where natural light, a beautiful green outlook and effortless modern living come together to create somewhere truly special.\r\n\r\nProudly positioned on a desirable corner site overlooking the greenery of Bonair Reserve, this beautifully maintained home makes the most of its sunny setting while offering all the ease of low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nStep inside and let the light do the talking. Bright, fresh and welcoming interiors combine contemporary finishes with a lovely sense of space. Whether you're gathering everyone around the table or winding down after a busy day, this is a home designed for enjoying life's everyday moments.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the modern kitchen brings people together, flowing effortlessly into the open-plan living and dining areas. Slide open the doors and step outside, where front and back decks offer space for summer barbecues, catching up with friends or simply putting your feet up in the sunshine.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four well-proportioned bedrooms give everyone their own space. The master suite is your private sanctuary, complete with a generous walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while a well-appointed family bathroom and convenient lower-level powder room add to the home's everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's that outlook. With the beautiful greenery of Bonair Reserve right across the road, you'll enjoy a refreshing sense of openness and connection to nature. Add the privacy and extra sense of space that come with its corner-site position, and you have a setting that's hard not to love.\r\n\r\nBeautifully cared for and just two years young, this fully fenced home is ready to enjoy, complete with internal-access garaging, additional off-street parking, a garden shed and the reassurance of the remaining Master Build warranty. With everything already in place, there's no need to wait for the perfect home to be built - this one could be yours in time for Christmas.\r\n\r\nWith Millwater, Silverdale and Orewa all within easy reach, you'll enjoy convenient access to local shops, schools, reserves and public transport. And when the beach is calling, Orewa's beautiful coastline is just a short drive away, while the estuary walkway offers a scenic route for walking or cycling.\r\n\r\nNow here's the exciting part. Our vendors have found their next home and are ready to make their move, creating an opportunity for someone new to enjoy everything this beautiful reserve-side home has to offer.\r\n\r\nIf sunshine lifts your spirits, a green outlook makes you smile and a beautifully maintained home is high on your wish list, don't leave this one for another day.\r\n\r\nGet in touch today and come see for yourself. Our vendors are ready for their next chapter - could yours begin here?",
